    "t0": 0.5,
    "t1": 10.648,
    "path": "out/narration/line_38.wav",
    "text": "Try it with hundreds of winning drops. Warm the board by just a billionth of a degree, and six replays in a hundred already miss. One drop's heat spoils more than half.",
    "phrases": [
     [
      0.5,
      2.26
